    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The default value on iOS is [`lowQualityZeroLatency`](avaudiotimepitchalgorithm/lowqualityzerolatency.md); on macOS, the default is [`timeDomain`](avaudiotimepitchalgorithm/timedomain.md).",
      "ko": "iOS의 기본값은 [`lowQualityZeroLatency`](avaudiotimepitchalgorithm/lowqualityzerolatency.md)이고, macOS의 기본값은 [`timeDomain`](avaudiotimepitchalgorithm/timedomain.md)입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "8373cbb3d439b0c2345173790bcfeef069c41aaa8231524746a08d397f2dd8bb",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "The device automatically mutes audio when [`timebase`](avqueuedsamplebufferrendering/timebase.md) is not supported by [`AVAudioTimePitchAlgorithm`](avaudiotimepitchalgorithm.md).",
      "ko": "기기는 [`timebase`](avqueuedsamplebufferrendering/timebase.md)가 [`AVAudioTimePitchAlgorithm`](avaudiotimepitchalgorithm.md)에서 지원되지 않을 때 오디오를 자동으로 음소거합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "bb0b1e530add798472787010f35a7dcb3897ec5708a873b049f152dacb646c4a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "Modifying this property while [`timebase`](avqueuedsamplebufferrendering/timebase.md) is not `0.0` may cause the rate to briefly change to `0.0`.",
      "ko": "이 속성을 [`timebase`](avqueuedsamplebufferrendering/timebase.md)가 `0.0`이 아닌 동안 수정하면 속도가 일시적으로 `0.0`으로 바뀔 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7b20a626e497cc41c947f9c11776f9938ef4333790dc9c72dd37600885d278e5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
